analysis.out
KS-22 - portico XYZ e barra articulada no mesmo no - N m
StaticStructural nsteps 1 deltat 1 nmodules 1
errorcheck
domain 3dShell
OutputManager tstep_all dofman_all element_all
ndofman 4 nelem 2 ncrosssect 2 nmat 1 nbc 3 nic 0 nltf 1 nset 5
Node 1 coords 3 0 0 0
Node 2 coords 3 3 0 0
Node 3 coords 3 3 2 0
# As translacoes em B sao comuns. A ponta do contraventamento tem suas proprias rotacoes.
RigidArmNode 4 coords 3 3 0 0 master 2 dofidmask 6 1 2 3 4 5 6 masterMask 6 1 1 1 0 0 0 doftype 6 2 2 2 0 0 0
Beam3d 1 nodes 2 1 2 zaxis 3 0 0 1
Beam3d 2 nodes 2 4 3 zaxis 3 0 0 1
SimpleCS 1 area 0.03 Iy 0.0001 Iz 0.00008 Ik 0.0001 beamShearCoeff 1.e18 material 1 set 1
SimpleCS 2 area 0.001 Iy 0.000025 Iz 0.000025 Ik 0.00001 beamShearCoeff 1.e18 material 1 set 2
IsoLE 1 d 7850 E 2.e11 n 0.3 tAlpha 0
BoundaryCondition 1 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 6 1 2 3 4 5 6 values 6 0 0 0 0 0 0 set 3
# C impede translacoes e a rotacao em torno do eixo longitudinal da barra BC (Y global).
BoundaryCondition 2 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 4 1 2 3 5 values 4 0 0 0 0 set 5
NodalLoad 3 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 6 1 2 3 4 5 6 Components 6 0 10000 -6000 900 0 6000 set 4
ConstantFunction 1 f(t) 1.
Set 1 elements 1 1
Set 2 elements 1 2
Set 3 nodes 1 1
Set 4 nodes 1 2
Set 5 nodes 1 3
#%BEGIN_CHECK% tolerance 0.00001
